MPICH Contributors
==================

MPICH is developed primarily at Argonne National Laboratory, operated by
UChicago Argonne, LLC. The organizations and individuals below have also
contributed code to MPICH. This list is incomplete; the complete record of
authorship is the git commit history.

This list is informational only. It does not indicate whether an
organization currently has a Contributor License Agreement with MPICH,
or which of its employees that agreement covers. New contributors should
confirm their CLA status with the MPICH maintainers.


